{"id":"f772xi4dz98hfujzf0k5r2fep","title":"IEA报告：柴油价格因炼油能力受限居高不下 尽管原油供应激增","originalTitle":"Diesel prices remain high despite global oil supply surge: IEA","summary":"IEA报告指出，尽管全球原油供应激增，柴油价格仍居高不下。主要因炼油产能受限导致供需错配，欧洲柴油价格较战前水平高出77%。市场对原油价格创新高的预期概率为4.5%，而WTI原油11月160美元目标价概率仅3%。需关注OPEC产量策略和中东地缘政治变化，以及EIA供需报告更新。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing"},"links":{"original":"https://cryptobriefing.com/diesel-prices-remain-high-despite-global-oil-supply-surge-iea/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T22:12:21.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T22:23:30.348Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T22:23:30.348Z","category":"macro","tags":["行情异动","研究报告"],"score":64,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"1990f3ed-9815-41ed-b600-e9781754c319","title":"IEA报告：全球原油供应激增难缓解欧洲柴油高价"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Estefano Gomez","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"1990f3ed-9815-41ed-b600-e9781754c319","title":"IEA报告：全球原油供应激增难缓解欧洲柴油高价"}],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fbMyZsW9O4RE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}